# iOS asset catalog images are source, not build output: the CallKit template and the app
# icon have to reach CI, and without this exception `*.png` swallowed them silently.
# AppIcon-1024.png was only tracked because it predates the rule above.
!RedmiGateway/ios/RedmiGateway/Assets.xcassets/**/*.png
